    "translation_id": "trans-wordpocket-ur",
    "chapter_number": 2,
    "verse_number": 9,
    "book_name_english": "Numbers",
    "book_name_urdu": "گنتی",
    "reference": "Numbers 2:9",
    "original_text": "جَمِيعُ المَعْدُودِينَ لِمَحَلةِ يَهُوذَا مِئَةُ أَلفٍ وَسِتَّةٌ وَثَمَانُونَ أَلفاً وَأَرْبَعُ مِئَةٍ بِأَجْنَادِهِمْ. يَرْتَحِلُونَ أَوَّلاً.",
    "source_name": "WordPocket Urdu Bible",
    "source_url": "https://wordpocket.com/lang_texts/ur/04/2.htm",
    "translation": "WordPocket Urdu Bible",
    "language": "ur",
    "created_at": "2026-09-14T07:58:48.193Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-14T07:58:48.193Z"
