    "chapter_number": 2,
    "verse_number": 10,
    "book_name_english": "Numbers",
    "book_name_urdu": "گنتی",
    "reference": "Numbers 2:10",
    "original_text": "«رَايَةُ مَحَلةِ رَأُوبَيْنَ إِلى التَّيْمَنِ حَسَبَ أَجْنَادِهِمْ. وَالرَّئِيسُ لِبَنِي رَأُوبَيْنَ أَلِيصُورُ بْنُ شَدَيْئُورَ",
    "source_name": "WordPocket Urdu Bible",
    "source_url": "https://wordpocket.com/lang_texts/ur/04/2.htm",
    "translation": "WordPocket Urdu Bible",
    "language": "ur",
    "created_at": "2026-09-14T07:58:48.193Z",
